@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@token = replace-with-jwt-token
@adminToken = replace-with-admin-jwt-token
@movieId = 1
@sourceId = 1
@commentId = 1

### Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### ==========================================
### AUTH (BE-03 / BE-04)
### ==========================================

### Registro de usuario
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "usuario_demo",
  "email": "demo@streambit.com",
  "password": "DemoPassword123!"
}

### Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "demo@streambit.com",
  "password": "DemoPassword123!"
}

### Perfil actual
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ==========================================
### CATÁLOGO Y REPRODUCCIÓN (BE-11 / BE-12 / BE-13)
### ==========================================

### Buscar películas disponibles
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/movies?q=matrix&only_available=true&page=1&page_size=20

### Película destacada y colecciones Home
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/catalog/featured
###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/catalog/collections

### Opciones de reproducción públicas
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/movies/{{movieId}}/playback-options?country=CO

### ==========================================
### FAVORITOS, LISTAS E HISTORIAL (BE-14 / BE-15)
### ==========================================

### Agregar a favoritos
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/favorites/{{movieId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear lista personal
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/lists
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Fin de semana",
  "description": "Películas pendientes"
}

### Registrar evento de reproducción
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/history/events
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "movie_id": {{movieId}},
  "source_id": {{sourceId}},
  "event": "started",
  "position_seconds": 0,
  "duration_seconds": 7200
}

### Consultar historial
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/history?page=1&page_size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ==========================================
### CALIFICACIONES, COMENTARIOS Y MODERACIÓN (BE-16 / BE-17 / BE-18)
### ==========================================

### Calificar película (visitante o usuario)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/movies/{{movieId}}/ratings
X-Visitor-Id: guest-demo-1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "score": 5
}

### Resumen de calificaciones
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/movies/{{movieId}}/ratings/summary

### Publicar comentario
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/movies/{{movieId}}/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "Excelente fotografía y sonido."
}

### Listar comentarios
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/movies/{{movieId}}/comments?page=1&page_size=20

### Denunciar comentario
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/comments/{{commentId}}/reports
X-Visitor-Id: guest-demo-1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "spoilers",
  "details": "Revela el final sin aviso."
}

### Cola de moderación (Admin / Analyst)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/moderation/reports?status=pending
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### ==========================================
### NOTIFICACIONES Y RECOMENDACIONES (BE-19 / BE-20 / BE-21)
### ==========================================

### Activar alerta de disponibilidad
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/availability-alerts/{{movieId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Bandeja de notificaciones
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/notifications?only_unread=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Recomendaciones generales o personalizadas
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/recommendations?limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ==========================================
### PUBLICIDAD PRE-ROLL (BE-22)
### ==========================================

### Solicitar anuncio pre-roll
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ads/preroll?movie_id={{movieId}}&source_id={{sourceId}}&playback_session_id=sess-1234&country=CO

### Registrar impresión pre-roll
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ads/impressions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "campaign_id": 1,
  "movie_id": {{movieId}},
  "source_id": {{sourceId}},
  "playback_session_id": "sess-1234",
  "event_type": "impression"
}

### ==========================================
### PANEL ADMIN, REPORTES Y PRIVACIDAD (BE-23 / BE-24 / BE-25)
### ==========================================

### Listado administrativo de películas
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/movies?page=1&page_size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Reporte general (Admin / Analyst)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/reports/overview
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Política de privacidad pública
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/privacy/policy

### Exportar datos personales
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/privacy/export
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
